        <h1 class="hero__title"><span>Issues Index February 2018 - NHS and Brexit continue to dominate public concern</span>
</h1>

                  <div class="hero__description">This month's Ipsos Issues Index poll records the highest scores for two separate issues since April 1997.</div>
        
        
                  <div class="hero__date">
            <time datetime="13.03.18">13.03.18</time>
          </div>
        
                  <div class="hero__share block-toolbar with-download-link">
            <span class="hero__share-title">Share</span>
            <ul class="block-social-sharing">
